@page "/free-agents"

@* Designed shell. Row D-33: name the requirement, render no numbers. *@

<PageTitle>Free Agents</PageTitle>
<PageHeader Title="Free Agents"
            Description="Players not rostered in your league, ranked for what they would add to your team." />

<NotBuiltState Title="Free agents cannot be computed yet"
               Description="This will rank unrostered players by what they add to your roster specifically — risers and fallers split into opportunity versus efficiency, short-term streamers against long-term holds, and category specialists for the categories you are losing."
               Requirement="R14 — Streaming advisor">
    <Blocked>
        <li><strong>There is no rostered-versus-available state.</strong> The domain stores your league's rules and your draft, not who owns whom mid-season. Without it, "free agent" has no meaning to compute.</li>
        <li>Usable-games counting — a game counts only if an eligible lineup slot is actually open that day — needs the streaming advisor.</li>
        <li>Riser and faller windows need per-game stat lines from the box-score importer (R11), which takes hours per season to backfill.</li>
    </Blocked>
</NotBuiltState>
